  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: Govern, protect, and unlock value from data.",
    "H2: From exposure risk to strategic advantage.",
    "H2: Protect and power your business with unified data governance.",
    "H2: Precise data classification, in context.",
    "H2: Data and information governance, relied on by the world's most trusted organisations.",
    "H3: “The rise of AI technologies means Information Management and Data Governance have never been more critical. T",
    "H3: “With Aiimi, I've added three key areas of business value: data compliance, cost, and efficiencies.”\n\n– Adam S",
    "H3: Making 5.7TB of critical historical data discoverable and usable at RES.",
    "H3: Saving Holland & Barrett 3,000 hours through automated compliance.",
    "H3: Mitigating risk and saving £1m in data storage costs at professional services firm.",
    "H3: AI-powered data management at BEIS, built to Government Digital Standards.",
    "H3: Driving 80% efficiency gain through data access at major manufacturer.",
    "H2: Data governance without the wait.",
    "H2: Better together: extending the reach of Microsoft Purview",
    "H2: AI depends on data you can trust.",
    "H2: Already using an AI copilot? We'll make your investment go further.",
    "H2: Resources for AI Readiness and Data Governance.",
    "H2: Talk to us about Data Governance."
